This app optionally loads the following third-party components at runtime:

  Ghostscript (via @okathira/ghostpdl-wasm)
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later
  Source: https://github.com/okathira/ghostpdl-wasm
  Upstream: https://ghostscript.com/
  Loaded on demand from:
    https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@okathira/ghostpdl-wasm@1.1.0/dist/gs.js
    https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@okathira/ghostpdl-wasm@1.1.0/dist/gs.wasm

Ghostscript-WASM is fetched by the user's browser directly from jsDelivr;
pdf-signer does not distribute, bundle, or modify it. The optional
"Normalize source PDFs before signing" toggle in identity settings
enables this feature; disable it to avoid the runtime dependency.
